y is a fresh challenge, packed with mayhem, spectacle, and unforgettable \u201cdid-that-just-happen?\u201d moments. Perfect for quick runs or deep sessions, <i>Heistfest</i> delivers pure replayable intensity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451220/extras/40d0d31bdf7d37959bc92edae7a2352f.poster.avif?t=1760056496\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451220/extras/40d0d31bdf7d37959bc92edae7a2352f.webm?t=1760056496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451220/extras/40d0d31bdf7d37959bc92edae7a2352f.mp4?t=1760056496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No story. No rules. Just you versus the world.</strong></p>","developers":["Amilcar Technologies"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451220/40a831ba74ef675cfc10cf0716fb8570d1c94a5e/header.jpg?t=1760056496","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Amilcar Technologies & Freedom Games - All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Catalina<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong